# Copy to .env.local and fill in to give online Duels a TURN relay (needed when both players are on strict NATs:
# school / office / mobile-carrier networks). Any TURN provider works, e.g. a free Metered "Open Relay" account or
# your own coturn server. These values are baked into the build and visible to players, so use relay-only
# credentials you're fine sharing.
VITE_TURN_URLS=turn:your-relay.example.com:80,turn:your-relay.example.com:443,turns:your-relay.example.com:443?transport=tcp
VITE_TURN_USERNAME=
VITE_TURN_CREDENTIAL=
